  "adaptations": [
    "Namespaces use MAIN path, lifecycle and protocol layers. Probe/position CLI uses the single eplyx path command tree.",
    "RPC mocks use Mutex to satisfy the shared Send+Sync transport contract; no provider is contacted. Provider origins use a fixed non-secret label.",
    "Source fixture references resolve to exact imported originals or the independently recorded MAIN encoding projections. No economic assertion changed.",
    "Compute quantities, analytical slots and decoded position timestamp use decimal strings. Raw RPC wire slots and MAIN AccountSnapshot rent_epoch encoding remain unchanged.",
    "CLI JSON failures use MAIN error objects and exit 2; protected outputs remain byte-identical.",
    "T6 already retained token-transfer and position proof unit suites; T7 adds all 56 remaining integration tests."
  ],
  "additional_checks": [
    "Address-based generic evidence pairing, duplicate/unwatched account refusal, explicit creation/absence, malformed token/mint/program refusal.",
    "Current path CLI determinism, output protection and empty-environment execution under parent credential sentinels.",
    "Bounded 64-route scan and lexicographically first compatible route with no substitution after missing final dependencies."
  ]
